<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Welcome — Milky Way Language</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@300;400&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg-deep: #0a0b0f;
    --bg-surface: #12141a;
    --bg-raised: #1a1d26;
    --accent-warm: #ffc84c;
    --accent-gold: #ffc63d;
    --accent-gold-light: #fff7bf;
    --accent-blue: #4a7cff;
    --accent-blue-pale: #dfe7ff;
    --text-primary: #e8e6e1;
    --text-secondary: #9a978f;
    --text-dim: #5a5750;
    --glyph-frame: #949698;
    --border-subtle: rgba(255, 200, 76, 0.08);
    --border-glow: rgba(255, 200, 76, 0.15);
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    background: var(--bg-deep);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* ── starfield background ── */
  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 10% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,0.4), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 30% 70%, rgba(255,255,255,0.25), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 55% 15%, rgba(255,198,61,0.3), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 70% 45%, rgba(255,255,255,0.3), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 85% 80%, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 20% 90%, rgba(223,231,255,0.3), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 45% 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.15), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 92% 25%, rgba(255,255,255,0.3), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 60% 85%, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 5% 55%, rgba(255,198,61,0.2), transparent);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .page { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  /* ── hero ── */
  .hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero-label {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-warm);
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease forwards 0.2s;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.6rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 1rem 0 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease forwards 0.5s;
  }

  .hero h1 em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--accent-warm);
  }

  .hero-intro {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease forwards 0.8s;
  }

  /* ── divider ── */
  .divider {
    width: 60px;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--accent-warm), transparent);
    margin: 2.5rem auto;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeIn 1s ease forwards 1s;
  }

  /* ── glyph lesson section ── */
  .lesson {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem 3rem;
  }

  .lesson-header {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.6s ease forwards 1.2s;
  }

  .lesson h2 {
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.6s ease forwards 1.3s;
  }

  .lesson p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.6s ease forwards 1.4s;
  }

  /* ── glyph showcase ── */
  .glyph-showcase {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease forwards 1.5s;
  }

  .glyph-hero-img {
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    object-fit: contain;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .lesson em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--accent-warm);
  }

  /* ── try it section ── */
  .try-section {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem 3rem;
  }

  .try-section h2 {
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .try-section p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .tool-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .tool-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .tool-link:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-glow);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .tool-icon {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-raised);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .tool-info { flex: 1; }

  .tool-name {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
  }

  .tool-desc {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .tool-arrow {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .tool-link:hover .tool-arrow {
    color: var(--accent-warm);
  }

  /* ── footer ── */
  .footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .footer-divider {
    width: 40px;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--text-dim), transparent);
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
  }

  .footer p {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .footer a {
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .footer a:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--accent-blue);
  }

  /* ── animations ── */
  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; }
    to { opacity: 1; }
  }

  /* ── mobile refinements ── */
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .hero { padding: 3rem 1.25rem 2rem; }
    .glyph-hero-img { width: 160px; height: 160px; }
    .lesson, .try-section { padding: 0 1.25rem 2.5rem; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <!-- ── HERO ── -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-label">You're in</div>
    <h1>Welcome to the <em>Milky Way Language</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-intro">
      You just took your first step into MWL — an experimental visual language 
      designed to be read across the galaxy. Here is your first glyph.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <!-- ── YOUR FIRST GLYPH ── -->
  <section class="lesson">
    <div class="lesson-header">Your first glyph</div>
    <h2>Constellation</h2>
    <p>
      Every MWL glyph sits inside a square frame — like a window into meaning. 
      This one means <em>constellation</em>: a pattern of stars seen from a 
      particular place in the galaxy.
    </p>

    <div class="glyph-showcase">
      <img src="images/constellation.png" alt="MWL glyph for constellation" class="glyph-hero-img">
    </div>

    <p>
      There are more than hundred glyphs like this — for stars, planets, ocean worlds, 
      galaxies, people, and ideas. Each one is a single visual concept of the night sky or deep space, drawn to be 
      understood without words.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <!-- ── TRY IT ── -->
  <section class="try-section">
    <h2>Try it yourself</h2>
    <p>
      These tools let you write in MWL right now — no installation, 
      nothing to download. 
    </p>

    <div class="tool-links">
      <!-- Update hrefs to your actual GitHub Pages URLs -->
      <a href="https://alex987654.github.io/MWL/MWL-Proper-Name-Glyph-Maker.html" class="tool-link">
        <div class="tool-icon">✦</div>
        <div class="tool-info">
          <div class="tool-name">Write Your Name in MWL</div>
          <div class="tool-desc">Turn your photo into a proper-name cartouche glyph</div>
        </div>
        <span class="tool-arrow">→</span>
      </a>

      <a href="https://alex987654.github.io/MWL/MWL-Story-Constellator.html" class="tool-link">
        <div class="tool-icon">◇</div>
        <div class="tool-info">
          <div class="tool-name">Compose a Phrase</div>
          <div class="tool-desc">Use the Story Constellator to write your first MWL text</div>
        </div>
        <span class="tool-arrow">→</span>
      </a>

      <a href="https://alex987654.github.io/MWL/" class="tool-link">
        <div class="tool-icon">☽</div>
        <div class="tool-info">
          <div class="tool-name">The Full Reference</div>
          <div class="tool-desc">Every glyph, every rule - the complete MWL guide</div>
        </div>
        <span class="tool-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── FOOTER ── -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-divider"></div>
    <p>
      MWL is an open, experimental project.<br>
      Source and glyphs on <a href="https://github.com/alex987654/MWL" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
